905
00:27:54,144 --> 00:27:56,073
Most people do both in stages:

906
00:27:56,073 --> 00:27:57,488
a small cushion first,

907
00:27:57,488 --> 00:28:00,317
around five hundred to one thousand dollars,

908
00:28:00,317 --> 00:28:02,310
then attack high interest debt,

909
00:28:02,310 --> 00:28:04,303
then build the cushion further.

910
00:28:04,483 --> 00:28:06,070
Without that first cushion,

911
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:08,187
every surprise adds new debt and you

912
00:28:08,187 --> 00:28:09,127
never get ahead.

913
00:28:09,477 --> 00:28:10,475
Question three.

914
00:28:10,655 --> 00:28:12,382
I earn good money but I'm still

915
00:28:12,382 --> 00:28:13,941
