919
00:28:19,317 --> 00:28:20,118
your income.

920
00:28:20,298 --> 00:28:21,714
The fix is the same.

921
00:28:21,894 --> 00:28:24,887
Track spending, cut one big fixed cost,

922
00:28:24,887 --> 00:28:27,880
automate saving, and send half of every

923
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:29,185
raise to savings.

924
00:28:29,365 --> 00:28:31,466
Income doesn't fix a spending gap.

925
00:28:31,646 --> 00:28:33,376
Only the gap fixes the gap.

926
00:28:33,726 --> 00:28:34,678
Question four.

927
00:28:34,858 --> 00:28:35,984
How long does it take?

928
00:28:36,164 --> 00:28:38,543
It depends on your income and expenses,

929
00:28:38,543 --> 00:28:40,433
but many people can build a one

930
00:28:40,433 --> 00:28:42,812
thousand dollar cushion in one to three

931
00:28:42,812 --> 00:28:45,130
months, and get one month ahead within

932
00:28:45,130 --> 00:28:45,557
a year.

933
00:28:45,737 --> 00:28:47,675
The first step is the hardest.

934
00:28:47,855 --> 00:28:50,036
After that, each step gets easier,

935
00:28:50,036 --> 00:28:52,473
